            "action_name": {
              "value": "Flooding Thrust"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: The quoppopak's ventral tube is in water\n\nThe quoppopak uses Tentacle Stab against a creature within reach; if either of these Strikes hits, the creature must attempt a 30 Reflex save. On a failed save, the quoppopak shoots water through its tentacles into the creature, dealing 2d6+5 bludgeoning damage and making the creature sickened 1 as its internal organs fill with water (double damage and sickened 2 on a critical failure)."
            },
